/**
 * OpenAPI 3.1 description of the tmbilling public API. Served at /openapi.json and
 * rendered at /docs. Hand-authored to match the implemented routes; the source of
 * truth for customer docs + SDK generation.
 *
 * (Auto-generating from the Zod route schemas is a follow-up; the surface is
 * stable enough that a maintained document is accurate and high-value now.)
 */

