          'Edits the words and the layout. Text uses the template language: `{{var}}`, `{{var | default: "text"}}`, `{{#if var}}…{{else}}…{{/if}}` and `{{#unless var}}…{{/unless}}`. The body accepts a small HTML subset (p, br, b, i, u, h1, h2, ul, ol, li, a) and is sanitised on save. A variable this email never has, or a section that is not closed, is a 400. The logo, colours, button link and footer stay engine-owned.',
        parameters: [bizParam, emailTypeParam, idempotencyHeader],
